### Milemark Vehicle Rental System - REST API reference
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (hupmant.rest-client)
### or with JetBrains IDEs (WebStorm / IntelliJ) built-in HTTP client.
### Just start the server (node server.js) and click "Send CodeLens" above each block.

@host = http://localhost:3000


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - List the whole fleet
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Filter the fleet by class (?type=)
### try: Compact | Sedan | SUV | Luxury | Bike
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles?type=Compact
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Only vehicles that are available right now (?available=true)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles?available=true
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Combine both filters
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles?type=SUV&available=true
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Single vehicle by id
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles/1
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Active rentals list
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/rentals
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET - Fleet summary stats
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/stats
Accept: application/json


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### POST - Add a new vehicle to the fleet
### Required: name, type, pricePerDay
### Optional: seats (default 5), gear (default Auto), fuel (default Petrol)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Audi A4 Quattro",
  "type": "Sedan",
  "pricePerDay": 75,
  "seats": 5,
  "gear": "AWD",
  "fuel": "Petrol"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### POST - Add a bike (minimal body - only the required fields)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Royal Enfield Classic 350",
  "type": "Bike",
  "pricePerDay": 30
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### POST - Validation error demo (missing name -> 400)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Sedan",
  "pricePerDay": 75
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### POST - Rent a vehicle (marks it unavailable)
### Optional: customerName (default "Customer"), days (default 1),
###           pickupLocation (default "Downtown - Fleet St. Depot")
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/rent/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Miller",
  "days": 4,
  "pickupLocation": "Airport Terminal 2"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### POST - Rent with a minimal body (server fills the defaults)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/rent/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT - Return a rented vehicle (marks it available again)
### No body needed.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/return/2
Content-Type: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT - Return the seeded Tesla (rental 101 / vehicle 6)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/return/6
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT - Error demo: unknown id -> 404
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/return/999
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE - Delete a vehicle by id
### Also removes any active rental of that vehicle.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/vehicles/6
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE - Error demo: unknown id -> 404
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/vehicles/999
Accept: application/json
